; An invalid option value is an error for that option only: the tolerance
; option still applies, so the transaction balances.
option "inferred_tolerance_default" "USD:0.5"
option "booking_method" "BOGUS"

2020-01-01 open Assets:A
2020-01-01 open Assets:B

2020-01-02 * "Residual within the configured tolerance"
  Assets:A   1 USD
  Assets:B  -1.4 USD
